* openSciLab's standard models (circuits/models/standard.lib).
* Written for openSciLab from published data sheet values (GPL-3.0-or-later, like openSciLab):
* typical behaviour of the parts, not the models of their makers. A model of a maker added as a
* library of the circuit (or of the settings) is used instead of one of the same name here.

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- diodes
